# Real-Time Testing API

A scalable real-time API testing and monitoring platform designed to automate API validation, monitor response performance, and provide instant analytics for developers and QA engineers. The project focuses on improving software reliability through automated request execution, live reporting, and performance tracking.

## Tech Stack

### Backend

* **Node.js** — Server-side runtime environment
* **Express.js** — REST API framework
* **WebSockets / Socket.IO** — Real-time communication
* **REST API Architecture** — API request handling and testing workflows

### Database

* **MongoDB** — Storage for test reports, API logs, and execution history
* **Mongoose** — ODM for MongoDB schema management

### Testing & Monitoring

* **Postman Collections / Newman** — Automated API testing
* **Jest / Mocha** — Unit and integration testing
* **Load Testing Concepts** inspired by tools like [Locust](https://github.com/locustio/locust?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

### Frontend (if applicable)

* **React.js** — Dashboard UI
* **Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap** — Styling and responsive UI
* **Axios** — API request handling

### DevOps & Deployment

* **Docker** — Containerization
* **GitHub Actions** — CI/CD automation
* **Render / Railway / Vercel** — Deployment platforms

